  "description": "Add-on IFileExtractor for Scrubkit that reads the pre-2007 binary Microsoft Office formats — Word (.doc), Excel (.xls), and PowerPoint (.ppt). Extracts the body text and the Title/Author/Subject document properties directly from the OLE2 compound-file streams — best-effort, fully offline, and with no dependencies beyond Scrubkit.Abstractions. Register it via ReadOptions.Extractors.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
