  "published": "2026-07-27T19:11:58.367Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.8.0 — HTML/RTF clean-text, Outlook .msg, and de-identification. New HtmlExtractor (.html/.htm) and RtfExtractor (.rtf) strip markup/control words to clean text instead of returning raw markup (BCL-only). New MsgExtractor reads Outlook .msg (OLE2 compound file) in Scrubkit.Email, completing the email family with no new package. StandardRedactorOptions gains StableTokens (+ TokenSalt) for deterministic, joinable pseudonymisation and RevealLast/MaskChar for format-preserving masks (keep the last 4 of a card); both are also exposed via the CLI --rules JSON. Full changelog: https://github.com/jjopensoftworks-blip/Scrubkit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
